# Line endings: LF in the repository and in the working tree.
#
# core.autocrlf is true on this machine, which would rewrite text files to
# CRLF on checkout. Everything on disk is already LF, so pinning eol=lf keeps
# the working tree exactly as it is instead of churning every file.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets — never normalize.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
